<title>FINLAND: HARTWALL 4-MTH PROFIT UP TO FIM 69.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>HARTWALL 4-MTH PROFIT UP TO FIM 69.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		  69.5 vs 21.1</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.13 vs 0.85</p>
<p> Net sales					  674.6 vs 550.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				  74.0 vs 33.9</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of six analysts' forecasts for Finnish</p>
<p>beverages maker Oy Hartwall Ab's profit before extras and tax</p>
<p>had been 46.5 million markka in a 38-64 million markka range.</p>
<p> Depreciation					42.5 vs 36.0</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 4.5 vs 12.8 charge</p>
<p> Minorities				 charge 13.3 vs 3.7 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 69.5 vs 21.1</p>
<p> Taxes for the period			    16.3 vs 8.6</p>
<p> Net profit					  38.1 vs 8.8</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    42.2 vs 28.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Oy Hartwall Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
